{
  "description": "Scaleway's OpenAPI export drops query parameters that belong to a proto `oneOf`, so `GetResourceCounts`, `ListServers`, `DeleteServer` lose filters the API takes. The official JS SDK sends them through `resolveOneOf` in `urlParams` \u2014 scaleway-sdk-js packages_generated/instance/src/v2alpha1/api.gen.ts \u2014 with the types in the sibling types.gen.ts. They are added as optional query members; the API enforces the one-of.",
